%
O0001 (BOLT CIRCLE, MAIN)
G21 G90 G17
G0 X0. Y0. Z5.
G65 P9010 X10. Y20. R30. A15. B6. K-2.
M30
O9010 (BOLT CIRCLE: X Y CENTRE, R RADIUS, A START ANGLE, B HOLES, K DEPTH)
#10 = 0 ;
WHILE [#10 LT #2] DO1
#11 = #1 + #10 * 360. / #2
X[#24 + #18 * COS[#11]] Y[#25 + #18 * SIN[#11]]
G1 Z#6 F100.
G0 Z5.
#10 = #10 + 1
END1
M99
%
